This is the long awaited sequel to Elite - Frontier. 
 
As I ama big fan of ELite, I could hardly contain myself when this game   
came on to the market.  I rushed to my nearesst software outlet and   
bought the CD-ROM version.  I thought I was in for some more of the   
excellent action and trading that was, ELITE. 
 
 
WRONG. WORNG. WRONG. WRONG. WRONG. 
 
 
This game is CRAP. It hasn't even been tested properly.  I would not even   
call it a Beta version, I would be hard pushed to call it an Alpha   
version. 
 
 
Gametek got 1 thing right with the game,  its installation.  At least it   
goes to the right directory.  AT least we get a choice of directory to   
install it into. 
 
However, thats where the good part of the game stops. 
You are not told to type SETUP after installing the game.  Without doing   
this, you will not get any sound. 
 
 
Some of the bugs which myself and a few friends have come across. 
  
#1   You have to turn your EMM386 RAM option into EMM386 NOEMS before the   
     game will load. 
 
#2   When choosing a port for the midi, you only get 1 option. Port 388.   
     This is great unless you have a soundblaster which does not have a    
     port 388. 
 
#3   When the games eventually loads you can change the settings.  WHat a   
     pity you can't keep the settings when you load the game in again.     
     You have to check all the options every time you die. 
  
#4   Getting past the above minor bugs, the real big one hit you.  About   
     every 5 to 1 minutes, the game freezes and produces n error code      
     0002 at memory location 00E0.  This is the same location of every     
     machine the game has been played on (7 different makes of pc)!! 
 
#5   The voices for the video do not match the pictures.  I had a female   
     voice and dialogue with a ma photograph.  (What, are we getting   
     tranvestites as weel as aliens in this game -- sorry CRAP game). 
 
 
#6......... 
 
I would love to go one but, I only have 100 years of access time on the   
net so I would run out of time before I got a 10th of the bugs reported. 
 
 
RECOMMENDION. 
============= 
 
Do NOT buy this game until there has been at least 10 bug fixes.  This   
way you will not be getting as ripped off as myself and my friends   
were. 
 
 
 
